  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5007.04 Application to be Transmitted. A copy of the approved application and permit for display or the denied application and reasons for denial, shall be transmitted to the commissioner by the operator of the fire display at least 3 business days prior to the date of the display.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8117, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRED: 1-10-05\n\nNew. #8261, eff 1-21-05; ss by #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
